# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
/target/
/gen/schemas

# The Xcode project is regenerated from gen/apple/project.yml on every
# `tauri ios build`, and it carries a per-developer Apple DEVELOPMENT_TEAM.
# Don't track it: it churns and would leak the signing team. project.yml (the
# durable source, incl. the Homebrew/cargo PATH fix in the build script) IS
# tracked, so a build regenerates a correct project.
/gen/apple/app.xcodeproj/

# Android isn't set up yet (`tauri android init` not run); these are orphan
# icon outputs from `tauri icon`. Revisit when Android is added.
/gen/android/
/icons/android/
